      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To generate embeddings for a batch of texts, I will use the Hugging Face Transformers library, which provides access to a variety of pre-trained models for natural language processing tasks, including text embedding. The provider-specific model identifier will be included in the code to make the external provider identifiable. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866105718,
          "start": 1789866103834
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc55541a0017Ln8Y1npBPObUG",
