      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `embed_text.py` file, I need to select a concrete external provider for generating embeddings. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which provides access to foundation models for generating embeddings. The code will import the necessary client from the Boto3 library and use the specific model identifier for the embedding task. </thinking>\n",
